     findings anywhere in the draft reject it (new NOTES do not).

HOW TO ANSWER
  Exactly 2 line(s), each with its own line-number marker, and nothing else:

    L1: <the new L1>
    L2: <the new L2>

  Every marker is required and each may appear once. A response missing one, or
  repeating one, or carrying a marker for a line outside the group, is discarded
  unread — which line is which would be a guess, and guessing wrong writes each
  line into another's place. No quotation marks, no commentary.
  Each line is at most 200 characters; a longer one is not accepted.
